It's confusing calling it R_0 sometimes because it might also refer to the Rstart

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:13.140
which was...but anyway,

00:17:13.149 --> 00:17:17.200
this is R_0 meaning some sort of reproduction rate and you can see that, umm

00:17:20.569 --> 00:17:24.459
we think the R_0 for the COVID-19 is about three, perhaps?

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:29.349
And it's kind of like a ratio of these two things, but this is possibly a good model for our disease

00:17:29.349 --> 00:17:31.980
we're looking at now - and obviously we haven't sorted out the units of time,

