00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:23.180
- Even if we don't know how much it's flattening, it does flatten it.

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:25.680
- Absolutely. And the more we can flatten it the better.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:31.020
The actual details of exactly what numbers we need to keep our society safe is guesswork from everybody

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:37.580
which is why, I mean, the government has got a difficult job - and everybody is going to be second guessing them, including experts

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:40.600
